.TH batten-baseline 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-baseline \- Record the findings that already exist, so only new ones fail
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten baseline\fR [\fB\-\-prune\fR] [\fB\-n\fR|\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record the findings that already exist, so only new ones fail
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-prune\fR
Drop baseline entries whose finding no longer exists, and ratchet reduced counts down
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Preview what would be applied, writing nothing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
